ollowers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-05-08T15:57:01Z","updated_at":"2024-05-08T15:57:01Z","body":"Before \"codegen\" the IR looks something like this when the binding is not used\r\n```mlir\r\nmodule attributes {hal.device.targets = [#device_target_rocm]} {\r\n  hal.executable private @func {\r\n    hal.executable.variant public @rocm_hsaco_fb target(#executable_target_rocm_hsaco_fb) {\r\n      hal.executable.export public @func ordinal(0) layout(#pipeline_layout) attributes {hal.interface.bindings = [#hal.interface.binding<0, 0>, #hal.interface.binding<0, 1>]} {\r\n      ^bb0(%arg0: !hal.device):\r\n        %c2 = arith.constant 2 : index\r\n        %c1 = arith.constant 1 : index\r\n        hal.return %c2, %c2, %c1 : index, index, index\r\n      }\r\n      builtin.module {\r\n        func.func @func() attributes {translation_info = #translation} {\r\n          %cst = arith.constant dense<1.000000e+00> : vector<1xf32>\r\n          ...\r\n          %12 = hal.interface.binding.subspan set(0) binding(1) type(storage_buffer) alignment(64) offset(%c0) : memref<128x128xf32>\r\n          ...\r\n          vector.store %cst, %12[%21, %11] : memref<128x128xf32>, vector<1xf32>\r\n          return\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n  util.func public @isolated_benchmark(%arg0: !hal.buffer_view) -> !hal.buffer_view attributes {iree.abi.stub, iree.reflection = {iree.abi.declaration = \"sync func @isolated_benchmark(%input0: tensor<128x256xf32>) -> (%output0: tensor<128x128xf32>)\"}} {\r\n    %c65536 = arith.constant 65536 : index\r\n    %c131072 = arith.constant 131072 : index\r\n    %c0 = arith.constant 0 : index\r\n    %c256 = arith.constant 256 : index\r\n    %c128 = arith.constant 128 : index\r\n    %element_type_f32 = hal.element_type<f32> : i32\r\n    %dense_row_major = hal.encoding_type<dense_row_major> : i32\r\n    hal.buffer_view.assert<%arg0 : !hal.buffer_view> message(\"input0\") shape([%c128, %c256]) type(%element_type_f32) encoding(%dense_row_major)\r\n    %0 = stream.tensor.import %arg0 : !hal.buffer_view -> tensor<128x256xf32> in !stream.resource<external>{%c131072}\r\n    %result, %result_timepoint = stream.resource.alloca uninitialized : !stream.resource<external>{%c65536} => !stream.timepoint\r\n    %1 = stream.cmd.execute await(%result_timepoint) => with(%0 as %arg1: !stream.resource<external>{%c131072}, %result as %arg2: !stream.resource<external>{%c65536}) {\r\n      stream.cmd.dispatch @func::@rocm_hsaco_fb::@func {\r\n        ro %arg1[%c0 for %c131072] : !stream.resource<external>{%c131072},\r\n        wo %arg2[%c0 for %c65536] : !stream.resource<external>{%c65536}\r\n      }\r\n    } => !stream.timepoint\r\n    %2 = stream.timepoint.await %1 => %result : !stream.resource<external>{%c65536}\r\n    %3 = stream.tensor.export %2 : tensor<128x128xf32> in !stream.resource<external>{%c65536} -> !hal.buffer_view\r\n    util.return %3 : !hal.buffer_view\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n```\r\nLooking at this, the pipeline layout includes both bindings (as does the dispatch) but the kernel only uses one of the bindings.\r\n\r\nThe llvm func we produce for rocm only takes a single argument however\r\n```\r\nllvm.func @func(%arg0: !llvm.ptr {llvm.align = 16 : i32, llvm.noalias}) attributes {translation_info = #iree_codegen.translation_info<None workgroup_size = [128, 2, 1] subgroup_size = 64>} {\r\n```\r\nI'm not sure if the input IR should be considered valid, but it does look like rocm might not be obeying the pipeline layout when constructing the llvm function.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/2100901011/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/2100908121","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/17305#issuecomment-2100908121","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/17305","id":2100908121,"node_id":"IC_kwDODGgK6M59OVBZ","user":{"login":"qedawkins","id":22101546,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTAxNTQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22101546?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins","html_url":"https://github.com/qedawkins","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-05-08T16:00:34Z","updated_at":"2024-05-08T16:00:34Z","body":"SPIR-V doesn't let this compile\r\n```\r\nin.mlir:47:15: error: failed to materialize conversion for result #0 of operation 'hal.interface.binding.subspan' that remained live after conversion\r\n        %16 = stream.binding.subspan %arg2[%c0] : !stream.binding -> memref<128x128xf32>\r\n              ^\r\nin.mlir:47:15: note: see current operation: %30 = \"hal.interface.binding.subspan\"(%11) {alignment = 64 : index, binding = 1 : index, descriptor_type = #hal.descriptor_type<storage_buffer>, operandSegmentSizes = array<i32: 1, 0>, set = 0 : index} : (index) -> memref<128x128xf32>\r\nin.mlir:50:9: note: see existing live user here: vector.store %cst, %13[%15, %10] : memref<128x128xf32>, vector<1xf32>\r\n        vector.store %cst, %16[%18, %14] : memref<128x128xf32>, vector<1xf32>\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/2100908121/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/2100908523","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/17305#issuecomment-2100908523","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/17305","id":2100908523,"node_id":"IC_kwDODGgK6M59OVHr","user":{"login":"benvanik","id":75337,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MzM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75337?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik","html_url":"https://github.com/benvanik","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"http